<p><strong>加班</strong></p>
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mentalimagerymirage" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6527580); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6527580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606816826" alt="MentalImageryMirage" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6527580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mentalimagerymirage" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6527580); return false;">MentalImageryMirage</a></span></p>
<p><strong>人事页：</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mirage-mental-imagery-for-kaf">http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mirage-mental-imagery-for-kaf</a></p>
<div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p>
